{"component_id_namespace":"ec077a53-0b40-5f21-b1fe-a62094d2476b","component_schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","components":[{"attributes":{"code":"TMC","legacy_node_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:AxB_ArtXXXI_13","page_type":"section"},"citation":"AxB Art. XXXI § 13","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/AxB_ArtXXXI_13","content_hash":"d10f4d501e2d76278ccb9356aff79b19592763d7b660cf36a8307ee0134877c2","heading":"SECTION 13. POINT OF CONTACT AND NOTICES","ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":null,"schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:axb-art.-xxxi-13:section","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/AxB_ArtXXXI_13","text":"MCImetro shall at all times maintain with the City a local point of contact who shall be available at all times to act on behalf of MCImetro in the event of an emergency.\nAll other notices between the parties shall be in writing and shall be made by personal delivery or by depositing such notice in the U.S. Mail, Certified Mail, return receipt requested. Any notice served by U.S. Mail or Certified Mail, return receipt requested, shall be deemed delivered five (5) calendar days after the date of such deposit in the U.S. Mail unless otherwise provided. \"Business day\" for purposes of this section shall mean Monday through Friday, City and/or MCImetro observed holidays excepted.\nThe City: | MCImetro:\nCity Clerk Attn: Brenda Younger 215 SE 7th St. Topeka, KS 66603 cclerk@topeka.org | MCImetro Access Transmission Services LLC d/b/a Verizon Access Transmission Services 600 Hidden Ridge Irving, TX 75038 Attn: Franchise Manager With copy to (except for invoices)(which copy will not constitute notice): Verizon Legal Department Attn: Network Legal Team 1300 I Street, NW 5th Floor Washington, D.C. 20005\nThe City:\nMCImetro:\nCity Clerk\nAttn: Brenda Younger\n215 SE 7th St.\nTopeka, KS 66603\ncclerk@topeka.org\nMCImetro Access Transmission Services LLC\nd/b/a Verizon Access Transm